# Design System

Colors: `#E30613` (primary), `#0A0A0A` (bg), `#1A1A1A` (cards), `#B3B3B3` (muted), `#FFFFFF` (text)
Fonts: Bebas Neue (headlines), Inter (body/buttons) via google_fonts
Cards: radius 18px, padding 16px
Primary button: red, white text, min height 48px, radius 16px
Tab bar: 5 icons ohne Label, flach, aktiver Tab rot mit rotem Unterstrich
Icons: outline only, inactive gray, active red
Animations: 250–300ms, sparsam
Every screen: loading, empty, error states
UI reference: `assets/mockups/`
